  "description": "Qamarain For Her by Amran is a sweet, fruity-floral, musky-amber fragrance crafted for women who love bright, feminine, long-lasting scents. It opens with juicy fruits, soft citrus, and a gentle sweetness , giving a youthful, uplifting start. The heart introduces rose, jasmine, and creamy florals , adding elegance and a smooth, romantic character. The base settles into warm amber, vanilla, soft musk, and delicate woods , creating a long-lasting, warm, feminine trail that feels both modern and refined. Perfect for customers who enjoy sweet fruity florals with a warm amber-vanilla finish .",
